## Raw maetrials endpoints

### Get all materials
GET localhost:8080/api/v1/materials?page=0&size=10

### Get material by id
GET localhost:8080/api/v1/materials/2


### Create new material
POST localhost:8080/api/v1/materials
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Aliminum",
  "stock": 200,
  "stockMin": 50,
  "unit": "kg",
  "supplierIds": [2]
}

